    "detailed_description": "Shout Seven is an online multiplayer strategy game. Each match consists of 2-4 players. The goal is to put 7 of your pieces in a row solely by moving your opponents pieces out of the way. If a stalemate occurs, victory goes to the player who has pushed the most pieces off the board.<br><br><strong>Competitive Multiplayer</strong><br>If you're interested in ranking up, you can use matchmaking to play against players from around the world. Just remember, only one player can hold the rank of monarch.<br><br><strong>Play With Friends</strong><br>If playing with your friends is more your speed, the lobby system is there for you. You can create a lobby for you and your friends or join one with a code from a friend.<br><br><strong>Summon the Beasts</strong><br>When you join a match, you will fight for 1 of 4 of the great beasts from the ancient British Isles.",
